@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Renderer output GPU regressions
+
+Run `test_renderer_outputs_gpu.py <configured runtime build directory>` with the fork's optional SlangPy and NumPy test dependencies. The GPU suite registers it with `camera_gpu_tests`. It needs the build's generated NUMOS host headers. It writes only compiled test fixtures under the build directory.
+
+The test compares the actual sRGB shader with its input in either color image, runs the lower-sky classifier at odd dimensions and exercises the production hidden-group history clears on a synthetic tile boundary. Exit code 0 means all GPU readbacks matched. Missing Python dependencies return 77.
